        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.kupi.com/en/explore/united-states/hughes/history",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Hughes evolved from a temporary stop into a fully‑fledged municipal entity with modern infrastructure.",
